            <h2 class="m-b-xs-0 axil-title hover-line m-b-xs-10">姜梅紅議員陪同姜鈞翔完成參選登記 期盼延續服務為地方承擔</h2>
            
	<div class="post-metas">
	  <ul class="list-inline">
		<li><i class="feather icon-user"></i><a href="catalog.php?type=author&author_id=36" title="任禮清" class="post-author">任禮清</a></li>
